        "color": 7,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 358,
        "content": "### 7. Is it worth acting on?\n\nThe model scores 1-5 for fit. Anything below your `minRelevance` stops here instead of filling Notion with noise.\n\nDrop it to 3 if you would rather sift more yourself."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
